OL,3,GNEWSA'We're running to help break
OL,4,Amental health stigma'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have launched a running group
OL,7,Fto honour their late friend and to
OL,8,Fbreak the stigma surrounding men's
OL,9,Fmental health.
OL,11,FBradley Hardy, Eimard Legaspi, Radek
OL,12,FKogut and Jacob Lidgett founded Miles
OL,13,FThat Matter after losing their friend
OL,14,FJake to suicide.
OL,16,FThe group meets twice a week in Lincoln
OL,17,Ffor runs, with the aim of creating a
OL,18,Fspace where people feel comfortable
OL,19,Ftalking about their feelings.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
